"Demon bugs are sandy grasshopper-like native bugs of Moon Thegund morphed by chaos."
"Nearly the whole species has high chaos potential, so they turn first as corruption rises."
"They magnify and spread chaos, though each bug has only a weak presence."
"They fly erratically and pass through ground, metal and walls, leaving holes, ash or resin."
"A bug touching skin wisps into smoke, leaving a cut veined silver and rot like fleshy sawdust."
"Their numbers swell two or three times, then disperse, leaving residue in the air."
"The ground they riddle turns sandy and caves in."
"They do not respond to stimuli and do not seem to eat."
"A hit on an Avowed leaves no wound but boils their authority and leaves them askew."
"Artonan has three words for them."
